  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Parliamentary support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP Parliamentary support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Parliament enabled to perform its core functions for improved legislation, participation, representation and accountability, as well as the promotion of good governance for improved lives of the people of Zimbabwe.&#xa0;
The Project Objectives presented as outcomes were as follows: a) Outcome 1: New laws enacted, and old laws aligned with the Constitution. b) Outcome 2: Oversight function of Parliament strengthened; Governance systems enhanced. c) Outcome 3: People&#x2019;s participation in legislation formulation, decision-making and related democratic processes increased. d) Outcome 4: Parliament&#x2019;s performance of its core functions strengthened through capacitating Parliament leadership and staff. e) Outcome 5: Gender Mainstreamed in Parliament systems and processes.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet &quot;Multi-Donor Support Programme for the Parliament and the Office of the Auditor General of Zimbabwe, 2015-2017&quot; avser st&#xf6;dja parlamentet att bli mer effektiva i att utf&#xf6;ra sitt mandat och prim&#xe4;ra funktioner f&#xf6;r att d&#xe4;rigenom f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra lagstiftning, representation och deltagande samt ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande av landets regereing. Programmet omfattar &#xe4;ven kapacitetsst&#xf6;d till landets riksrevision i dess sj&#xe4;lvst&#xe4;ndiga roll att till parlamentet rapportera om f&#xf6;rvaltningen av offentliga resurser. 

Programmets budget &#xe4;r ca 4,8 MUSD. EU avser bidra med 2,1 MUSD (1,8 MEURO) och UNDP med 1,0 MUSD. Sverige f&#xf6;resl&#xe5;s bidra med de &#xe5;terst&#xe5;ende ca 1,7 MUSD.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Capacity Building Phase 2</narrative>
  </description>
